,"reputation":"1350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1023705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[63,73,62,54,50,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1023705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10125","city":"CS1035","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[63,73,62,54,50,57],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1023705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，邓艾麾下部将。姜维成功抵御邓艾进攻时，师纂买通蜀国宦官黄皓，散布姜维降魏的谣言，使得姜维不得不奉命返回退守。后又随邓艾偷渡阴平，覆灭蜀国，刘禅投降后领益州刺史一职。264年，他因参与诬陷邓艾而被田续所杀，死状惨烈。","tc":"魏國武將，鄧艾麾下部將。姜維成功抵御鄧艾進攻時，師纂買通蜀國宦官黃皓，散布姜維降魏的謠言，使得姜維不得不奉命返回退守。后又隨鄧艾偷渡陰平，覆滅蜀國，劉禪投降后領益州刺史一職。264年，他因參與誣陷鄧艾而被田續所殺，死狀慘烈。","en":"Officer of Wei, a subordinate officer under Deng Ai. When Jiang Wei successfully repelled Deng Ai's attacks, Shi Zuan bribed the Shu eunuch Huang Hao to spread rumors of Jiang Wei's defection to Wei, forcing Jiang Wei to withdraw under imperial orders. He later followed Deng Ai on the secret march through Yinping that destroyed Shu. After Liu Shan's surrender, Shi Zuan was appointed Lt. Governor of Yi Province. In 264, he was killed by Tian Xu for his role in falsely incriminating Deng Ai, dying a gruesome death.","jp":"魏の武将で、鄧艾配下の部将。姜維が鄧艾の侵攻を食い止めた際、師纂は蜀の宦官・黄皓を買収して姜維が魏に降伏するという流言を流させ、姜維をやむなく命に従い撤退させた。その後も鄧艾に従って陰平を越えて蜀を滅ぼし、劉禅が降伏した後は益州刺史に任じられた。264年、鄧艾を陷れる謀略に関与したため田続に討たれ、無残な最期を遂げた。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 등애 휘하의 부장이다. 강유가 등애의 공격을 성공적으로 막아내자, 사찬은 촉나라 환관 황호를 매수하여 강유가 위나라에 항복하려 한다는 유언비어를 퍼뜨렸고, 이로 인해 강유는 명을 받들어 군사를 물려 수비할 수밖에 없었다. 이후 등애를 따라 음평을 은밀히 넘어 촉나라를 멸망시켰으며, 유선이 항복하자 익주자사 직을 맡았다. 264년, 등애를 모함하는 데 가담했다가 전속에게 살해당하여 참혹한 최후를 맞이했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10236","remark":"","surname":"师","surnameTc":"師","surnameEn":"Shi","surnameJp":"師","surnameKr":"사","surnameOther":"","name":"纂","nameTc":"纂","nameEn":"Zuan","nameJp":"纂","nameKr":"찬","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"师纂","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"234","city":"CS1030","gender":"0","rule":"63","force":"73","wise":"62","politics":"54","charm":"50","will":"57","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"76/29/29/29/29/20/50/29","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1006205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3900","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"3800","strategy":"","strategy2":"1005001","professions":"1/3/1/0/0/0/1/1/0/1/0/0/1/0/1/0/1/2/1/0/0/0/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"27","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1500","evaluate":"-4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"215","show":"234","death":"264","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1006905","helmet":"WP1023705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;2/1;25/1;28/1;45/1;59/1;13/1;14/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"魏国武将，邓艾麾下部将。姜维成功抵御邓艾进攻时，师纂买通蜀国宦官黄皓，散布姜维降魏的谣言，使得姜维不得不奉命返回退守。后又随邓艾偷渡阴平，覆灭蜀国，刘禅投降后领益州刺史一职。264年，他因参与诬陷邓艾而被田续所杀，死状惨烈。","descriptionTc":"魏國武將，鄧艾麾下部將。